-- title:
--   Local Atkin–Lehner element at a prime not dividing the level
-- statement:
--   Let $a,b\in\mathbb{Q}$ and let $q'$ be a prime such that $\mathbb{H} = \mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$ is definite and ramified exactly at $q'$, in the sense that $a<0$, $b<0$ and, for every height-one prime $v$ of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$, every nonzero element of $\mathbb{H}\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{Q}_v$ is a unit precisely when $q'\in v$. Let $R$ be a $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $\mathbb{H}$ which is an Eichler order of level $N\in\mathbb{N}$, i.e. $R=\Lambda_1\cap\Lambda_2$ for maximal orders $\Lambda_1,\Lambda_2$ (orders maximal under inclusion among orders) with the index of $R$ in $\Lambda_1$ equal to $N$. Let $q$ be a prime with $q\neq q'$ and $q\nmid N$, and let $v$ be a height-one prime of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ containing $q$. Write $R_v\subseteq \mathbb{H}\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{Q}_v$ for [`Submodule.localBox R v`](def/Submodule_LocalBox.html#L40), the additive subgroup generated by the elements $z\otimes c$ with $z\in R$ and $c$ in the valuation ring of $\mathbb{Q}_v$. Then there is a unit $w$ of $\mathbb{H}\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{Q}_v$ with: $w\in R_v$, $q\,w^{-1}\in R_v$, $w^{-1}\notin R_v$ and $q^{-1}w\notin R_v$ (the scalars being images of $q,q^{-1}\in\mathbb{Q}$ under the structure map); the same two assertions $q\cdot w^{-1}\in R_v$, $q^{-1}\cdot w\notin R_v$ for the $\mathbb{Q}$-scalar action; $w\cdot w$ equal to the image of $q$; and, for every additive subgroup $O'$ of $\mathbb{H}\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{Q}_v$ characterised by $x\in O'\iff w^{-1}xw\in R_v$, the index of $R_v\cap O'$ in $R_v$ equals $q$.
--
--   This provides the local Atkin–Lehner (elementary divisor $(1,q)$) element of the completion of an Eichler order at a split prime $q$ not dividing the level, together with the index $q$ of the intersection with the conjugated order. It is used in the Čerednik–Drinfeld tower to identify the intersections of orders arising from the prime and level Hecke sets as Eichler orders and to produce the corresponding storeys.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_QuaternionAlgebra_IsEichlerOrder_exists_units_localBox_atkinLehner_of_prime_of_not_dvd.lean

